**/.DS_Store
**/node_modules
**/prompts_master.md

# other dependencies
**/.pnp
**.pnp.js

# testing
**/coverage

# production
**/build
**/dist

# logs
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# IDE
.idea
.vscode

# Environment variables - NEVER commit .env files with sensitive data
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

# Exception: .env.example is a template file and SHOULD be committed
# Make sure it doesn't contain real credentials
!.env.example
